{"ok": true, "ai": true, "picks": {"2016": {"summary": "这个逻辑到今天已经不成立了，我认识的很多公司招聘时，老板都曾说过，只招本科，轮岗培养", "summary_from": "知乎用户FH4004", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/39676501/answer/82605761?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2017": {"summary": "但本科生就业率相较于研究生只低了1.2%", "summary_from": "僧僧", "summary_url": "https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/26713574?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2019": {"summary": "研究生真的比本科生更好找工作吗", "summary_from": "一只蜜蜂", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/53405587/answer/597563411?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2020": {"summary": "但学历并不代表一切，与研究生经历相比，本科同学们在职场中的优秀经历，同样也是他们找工作时的亮点所在", "summary_from": "郭老师Miles", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/394047110/answer/1214971976?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2021": {"summary": "读研三年虽然比大学毕业就出来工作少赚一些钱，但是研究生学历可以让你站在更高就业起点，有更多的就业选择", "summary_from": "郑炳考研经济学", "summary_url": "https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/344183239?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2022": {"summary": "不考研的本科毕业，找工作的范围比研究生的小，层次也比研究生的要低很多", "summary_from": "职场火锅pro", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/440418850/answer/2422728420?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2023": {"summary": "如果你热爱所学专业，研究生毕业后能比本科找到更好的工作，考研能让你未来有更高的起点，那对你来说读研就是值得的", "summary_from": "影疏", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/440418850/answer/2942373798?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2024": {"summary": "本科生就业率完爆研究生就业率", "summary_from": "榛十五", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/461310407/answer/1904930282?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2025": {"summary": "本科既然这么难找工作，那读研之后是不是就会好很多", "summary_from": "安安", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/521059703/answer/1917242170924077203?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}, "2026": {"summary": "读研后直接解锁高端岗位投递资格，避开大量本科生内卷，能拿到更多优质工作机会，求职选择权牢牢握在自己手里，不再是被动找工作", "summary_from": "热忱ing", "summary_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2074410974522651143/answer/2076002838984107328?utm_medium=openapi_platform&utm_source=cf621feb3f2d"}}}